OL,3,GNEWSACouncil begins procurement process
OL,4,Afor new electric Corran Ferry
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighland Council has begun the
OL,7,Fprocurement process to secure a new
OL,8,Fmulti-million-pound electric ferry to
OL,9,Fnavigate the Corran Narrows.
OL,11,FThe Corran Ferry service is one of
OL,12,FScotland's busiest single-vessel
OL,13,Fcrossings, but is currently served by
OL,14,Fageing boats.
OL,16,FThe current ferry, the MV Corran, is 25
OL,17,Fyears old and has suffered a number of
OL,18,Fbreakdowns in recent years.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
