OL,3,GNEWSACouncil begins procurement process
OL,4,Afor new electric Corran Ferry
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighland Council hopes to award the
OL,7,Fcontract for the new electric vessel in
OL,8,FMarch next year, with the replacement
OL,9,Fanticipated to enter service in early
OL,10,F2029.
